#. Key:	Menu.DesactivezMouvementCameraPendantMarche
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRPlayerController.cpp(2811)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRPlayerController.cpp(2811)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Menu.DesactivezMouvementCameraPendantMarche"
